! final.md — hand-back, 2026-11-06

Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/b1-lift/stall-read/final.md` (hand-back, file date 2026-11-06); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/b1-lift/stall-read/index]].

